---
import { asset } from '../data/site.js';
---
<section class="sec story light" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <figure><img src={asset('img/pub.jpg')} alt="A Rottweiler resting by a bar stool in a warm, dark pub" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"></figure>
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Why a Rottweiler</div>
      <h2 id="story-h">A guard dog with <em class="g">manners.</em></h2>
      <p>A Rottweiler is calm until it matters. It knows its people, it holds its ground and it never cuts corners. That is how we brew.</p>
      <p>Every Rottweiler beer is made to one written standard. Same recipe, same checks, wherever it is brewed and poured.</p>
      <div class="traits">
        <div><b>Loyal</b><span>One written spec for every batch at every site.</span></div>
        <div><b>Patient</b><span>At least 30 days in a cold cellar for our lagers. 36 for the Dry.</span></div>
        <div><b>Checked</b><span>Every batch is tested against its spec before it leaves.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="quote" aria-label="Brand line">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="orn"><svg width="34" height="34" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#badge"/></svg></div>
    <blockquote>Calm until it matters. <i>Then it delivers.</i></blockquote>
    <cite>The Rottweiler way of brewing</cite>
  </div>
</section>
